\description{
\code{cdrgam.fit()} fits an already prepared \code{cdrgam_design}, such as one returned
by \code{\link[=prepare_cdrgam]{prepare_cdrgam()}}, without rebuilding its stream histories. It does not
parse formulas.

\code{cdrgam()} compiles untiled impulse and response streams and fits the
resulting model. Use \code{\link[=prepare_cdrgam]{prepare_cdrgam()}} followed by \code{\link[=cdrgam.fit]{cdrgam.fit()}} when a
compiled design will be reused across fits.
}
